## 1. Purpose and Validation Method

This analysis evaluates whether the Stage 2 technical specification and Stage 4 market-data memo provide sufficient information for an independent LLM to reproduce the FX hedge analysis.

The independent LLM received only the Stage 2 specification and Stage 4 market-data memo in a fresh conversation. It was not given the workbook or coached during its analysis. Its complete response is preserved in the [independent LLM output](2026-11-24-scenario-33-independent-llm-output.md).

The independent results are compared against the Excel workbook. Differences are classified as an LLM error, workbook error, or specification ambiguity. The calculations below are also independently recomputed by hand.

