### 4.3 Put option floor at 95% of initial spot

Future spot:

`1.0968 × 0.95 = 1.04196 USD/EUR`

Put premium paid upfront:

`€14,500,000 × $0.0194 = $281,300.00`

Carried premium:

`$281,300.00 × 1.02325556 = $287,841.79`

Put proceeds:

`€14,500,000 × MAX(1.04196, 1.0968) − $287,841.79`

`= $15,903,600.00 − $287,841.79`

`= $15,615,758.21`

The put establishes a modeled minimum settlement value of $15,615,758.21 after the carried premium.

